  "details": "Currently, printed photos appear in VRChat camera shots.\n\nBecause these photos are treated as part of the same layer as remote players, they are visible during photo sessions and can unintentionally appear in group photos.\n\nSuggestion:\n\nPlease consider rendering printed photos on the UI layer or item layer instead of the same layer as remote players.\n\nThis would prevent them from appearing in camera captures, improving the user experience when taking photos with others.\n\nSame:\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/add-an-option-to-hide-printed-photos-from-the-camera",
